/* The natives of the imports the compiler knows, behind those of natives.def in this order when a program imports them (ImportedPreludes.Insert): graphics,
 * windows, reflection - FIRE_BRIDGE_NATIVE(import, index, name), the index within the import. This file is the source (since M1; `forge tables` wrote it
 * from the C# bridges before): a new native goes at the end of its import, with the C library of graphics/windows and the VM (vm_natives.c, vm_reflect.c). */
